--- chunk 4
title: Why does the replicator return cold Earl Grey? Screenshot attached. | text: claude-sonnet-5 — Sat 11 Apr 2364 14:30

Pattern buffer 3 is offline, so the replicator falls back to buffer 1, whose thermal profile defaults to ambient. Bringing buffer 3 back will fix the temperature.


